OL,3,ACouncil leaders wary of radical plan to
OL,4,Aredraw Scotland's local government map
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leaders have been voicing their
OL,7,Fconcerns about proposals for the
OL,8,Fbiggest shake up of local government in
OL,9,F30 years.
OL,11,FSome have warned that Scottish
OL,12,Fgovernment plans to potentially
OL,13,Fstreamline the number of authorities
OL,14,Ffrom 32 to six will not save money.
OL,16,FOthers have questioned the potential
OL,17,Fimpact on rural parts and the "absurd"
OL,18,Ftimeline.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
