OL,3,ACouncil leaders wary of radical plan to
OL,4,Aredraw Scotland's local government map
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder proposals for a new two-tier
OL,7,Fsystem, the regional bodies would focus
OL,8,Fon major issues such as education and
OL,9,Feconomic growth.
